invalid type: string "The Duel’s Resolution and the Wounding of Landis\n\nDonnegan's skill prevails as he outmaneuvers Landis in a deadly duel, shooting him and winning the tense confrontation.\n\nAt the final chime of the clock, Donnegan's shot rang out, striking Landis in the shoulder. The other's gunfire missed or was ineffective; Landis fell heavily to the ground, wounded but alive.", expect